BUILD AND RUN ON ILAB
    make
    ./memgrind
    make tests
    make check
    make clean

make builds memgrind. make tests builds test_correctness, test_errors, and
memtest. make check runs the three normal programs: test_correctness,
memtest, and memgrind. Run the error cases separately as described below.
All build commands are written explicitly in Makefile, using C99, -g, -Wall.

